msgstr "Langkah 3: Eksekusi memakai primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `RandomMeas.jl` to draw 2,048 Haar-random measurement settings and sample 256 shots from each, then split the settings evenly into training and testing sets. Split by setting rather than by shot: shots from the same setting share its rotations, so they are not independent.\n"
msgstr "Pakai `RandomMeas.jl` untuk mengundi 2.048 measurement setting Haar-random dan mengambil 256 shot dari masing-masingnya, lalu bagi setting secara merata menjadi set pelatihan dan pengujian. Bagi per setting, bukan per shot: shot dari setting yang sama berbagi rotasinya, jadi tidak independen.\n"

